# FastAPI specific
instance/
db.sqlite3
*.log
*.pid
*.seed
*.env
# Every .env sibling, not just the bare name. `.env` and `*.env` between them miss
# `.env.bak.<timestamp>`, `.env.local`, `.env.prod` — files that hold the same
# SECRET_KEY and SMTP_PASSWORD as the original and were one `git add -A` from being
# published. Ship .env.example and nothing else.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

